    "/refund": {
      "post": {
        "security": [
          {
            "APIKeyHeader": []
          },
          {
            "merchantCode": []
          }
        ],
        "description": "Create a refund for a previously created invoice.\n\n## Authentication & Request Signing\n\nThis endpoint requires three headers:\n\n- `X-API-Key`: Your API key.\n- `X-Timestamp`: UNIX timestamp (seconds).\n- `X-Signature`: `Base64(HMAC_SHA256(secret, \"<METHOD>\\n<PATH>\\n<TIMESTAMP>\"))`\n\n**Canonical string to sign** for this operation:\n\n```\nPOST\n/refund\n<UNIX_SECONDS_TIMESTAMP>\n```\n\nExample:\n\nMethod:    `POST`\nPath:      `/refund`\nTimestamp: `1234567890`\nSecret:    `test-secret-key`\n\nString to sign (including newlines):\n```\nPOST\n/refund\n1234567890\n```\n\nBase64(HMAC-SHA256(secret, string)) =\n`kJo7ZC9/S2oMN2LjdboCE5Ut5bFttpCc+QrDReKIXbA=`\n",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "tags": [
          "invoice"
        ],
        "summary": "Request a new Refund",
        "operationId": "requestRefund",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "type": "string",
            "name": "X-Api-Key",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Unix timestamp used for HMAC signature",
            "name": "X-Timestamp",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "HMAC signature of method, path, and timestamp",
            "name": "X-Signature",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "description": "Refund request details",
            "name": "body",
            "in": "body",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/RefundRequest"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "successful operation",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/Refund"
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid parameters",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Invoice Not found",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "405": {
            "description": "Invalid input",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Unprocessable content",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal server error",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ErrorResponse"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
